coverage shown above in accordance with the\nState of New Mexico Flexble Spending Account Plan, Section 125. Such reductions, considered as elective contributions under the plan, shall\n\u2018commence within the payroll cycle in which tis election is received by my payroll center. | understand that any amounts remaining in my accounts)\nnot used for eligible expenses incurred during my coverage period wil be forfeited in accordance with curent plan provisions and tax laws,\n\nEmployee's signature: Date\n\nReturn this form to your group representative.\n\nNMEF(10/12)",
